          "html": "<h3>Hello kate!</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks for registering at Polr Baseline. To use your account,\r\nyou will need to activate it by clicking the following link:</p>\r\n\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n<a href='http://polr.test/activate/kate/<RECOVERY_KEY>'>\r\n    http://polr.test/activate/kate/<RECOVERY_KEY>\r\n</a>\r\n\r\n<br />\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks,</p>\r\n<p>The Polr Baseline team.</p>\r\n\r\n--\r\n<br />\r\nYou received this email because someone with the IP 198.51.100.20 signed up\r\nfor an account at http://polr.test. If this was not you,\r\nyou may ignore this email.\r\n\r\n",
          "text": "Hello kate!\n-----------\n\nThanks for registering at Polr Baseline. To use your account, you will need to activate it by clicking the following link:\n\nhttp://polr.test/activate/kate/<RECOVERY_KEY> ( http://polr.test/activate/kate/<RECOVERY_KEY> )\n\nThanks,\n\nThe Polr Baseline team.\n\n--\nYou received this email because someone with the IP 198.51.100.20 signed up for an account at http://polr.test. If this was not you, you may ignore this email."
        }
      ]
